# ♟️ Chess AI – Self‑Improving Neural Engine

**Version 1.0** – A complete Python chess engine with a dual‑head neural network (value + policy), self‑play training, PGN parsing, capture‑tactical learning, web interface, and a fully automated continuous‑improvement pipeline.  
Runs on Android/Termux and desktop Linux.

